></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="371,1211 371,1223 373,1229 379,1235 384,1236 388,1242 442,1242 444,1241 477,1240 491,1233 496,1225 495,1209 487,1201 480,1198 473,1198 471,1197 417,1197 392,1197 381,1201"><p>ČO TO ROBÍŠ?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="454,1380 454,1407 464,1433 478,1445 504,1454 528,1455 597,1455 628,1453 654,1442 666,1430 672,1411 670,1377 663,1364 648,1351 628,1344 625,1340 539,1340 499,1343 473,1354 458,1369" type="audio"><p>PO POSLEDNOM UPGRADE SI NECHAL NASTAVENIA NA DEFAULT HODNOTÁCH, ČO ZNAMENÁ, ŽE TVOJI PRIATELIA MÔŽU VIDIEŤ SVET ...</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#8e2f28" points="741,523 842,528 842,546 740,539" type="thought" inverted="True" text-rotation="356"><p>TENTO PIATOK!</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#000000" points="404,596 522,605 520,631 402,624" type="sign" inverted="True" text-rotation="356"><p>... pre perfektné oholenie!</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
