<text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="253,923 222,919 208,896 220,877 246,869 306,869 332,881 333,906 314,921"><p>MOŽNO PRED PIATIMI MINÚTAMI ...</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="236,974 232,947 253,928 340,928 365,939 370,967 354,987 320,993 256,989"><p>... KEĎ EŠTE EXISTOVALI SERVRE SPROUTU.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#fdffff" points="674,960 884,960 884,998 677,998" type="code"><p>PROJEKT NA ZÍSKANIE INFORMAČNEJ KONTROLY</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#fdffff" points="738,1018 864,1018 864,1054 737,1054" type="code"><p>DATABÁZY VYMAZANÉ.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#fdffff" points="710,1075 854,1075 854,1110 712,1110" type="code"><p>PRÍSTUP NA iOČÍ ZRUŠENÝ.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="435,1125 435,1133 439,1145 447,1153 457,1157 462,1157 467,1158 503,1158 533,1157 535,1155 544,1153 552,1145 553,1141 553,1124 551,1120 543,1112 532,1107 499,1107 464,1107 448,1111"><p>UFFF. JEŽIŠI KRISTE NA NEBESIACH ...</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
