,651"><p>BUDDY. POČUJEŠ MA?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="79,852 70,844 72,832 86,828 128,828 141,840 137,852 107,858"><p>ČO ...</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="98,891 92,877 99,864 146,864 161,872 158,889 135,894"><p>JANE?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="52,930 48,920 52,908 69,899 142,899 156,911 156,930 140,938 66,938"><p>SI V PORIADKU?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="258,919 260,900 272,888 326,888 332,909 320,926 281,927" type="audio"><p>JE MI FAJN.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="76,1315 78,1333 90,1346 120,1354 224,1354 243,1346 252,1337 255,1330 253,1310 243,1298 234,1292 225,1292 215,1290 135,1290 100,1292 89,1298 81,1306"><p>MOMENT ... SYSTÉM JE MIMO PREVÁDZKY ... AKO TO ... AKO TO ŽE TY ...</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="533,854 507,846 504,826 514,814 564,814 580,825 580,846 556,854"><p>POZRI, MAMI.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="530,894 524,873 536,858 600,858 614,872 610,895 587,902 550,903"><p>ÚPLNE BEZ DOTYKU.</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="522,953 524,937 534,931 585,931 593,948 580,962 536,961" type="audio"><p>JANE ...</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="519,1283 499,1265 507,1243 524,1238 586,1238 606,1253 603,1276 573,1284"><p>BUDDY ... <emphasis>ĎAKUJEM.</emphasis></p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="540,1339 542,1320 555,1313 604,1313 609,1331 597,1346 562,1344"><p>... ČOŽE?</p></text-area><text-area bgcolor="#ffffff" points="496,1409 490,1388 509,1372 574,1372 594,1390 580,1415 534,1418"><p>DAJ MI SEKUNDU ...</p></text-area></text-layer></page>
